1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,247
This is Episode 32.

3
00:00:07,247 --> 00:00:11,422
Maya wants to invite all her friends to a party.

4
00:00:11,422 --> 00:00:13,311
She shouts.

5
00:00:13,311 --> 00:00:16,050
Everyone talks at once.

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,191
Nobody hears.

7
00:00:18,191 --> 00:00:21,449
She hands out notes one by one.

8
00:00:21,449 --> 00:00:24,308
One note falls in a puddle.

9
00:00:24,308 --> 00:00:27,021
The post office can help.

10
00:00:27,021 --> 00:00:31,236
The letter box holds every note in a neat line.

11
00:00:31,236 --> 00:00:34,081
First in, first out.

12
00:00:34,081 --> 00:00:36,462
Nothing gets lost.

13
00:00:36,462 --> 00:00:39,547
The town horn calls once.

14
00:00:39,547 --> 00:00:43,071
Every friend hears at the same moment.

15
00:00:43,071 --> 00:00:50,385
The sorting table sends the round parcel down the round chute and the square one down the square chute.

16
00:00:50,385 --> 00:00:52,420
Quiet street.

17
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:54,813
Every friend told.

18
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:56,861
Nothing lost.

19
00:00:56,861 --> 00:00:59,853
Now you know the post office!

20
00:00:59,853 --> 00:01:04,547
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

